e; village unclear"}, {"id": "0015_L5_parents_07", "text": "[Сдлимеръ?] прихода", "status": "draft", "note": "first word illegible to me (expected Салантовскаго?); connecting dash between words"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_01", "text": "Воспріемниками были", "status": "draft", "note": "tops of the next line's letters cut at bottom; text itself clear"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_02", "text": "Ксендзъ Казим[и?]ръ [Валь?]-", "status": "draft", "note": "godfather surname start"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_03", "text": "ск[ій?], съ дѣвицею [Евою?]", "status": "draft", "note": "godmother name"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_04", "text": "[Онѣсъскою?].", "status": "draft", "note": "godmother surname; long flourish not transcribed"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_05", "text": "", "status": "rejected_crop", "note": "only a flourish, no text"}, {"id": "0015_L5_godparents_07", "text": "", "status": "rejected_crop", "note": "only a flourish, no text"}]
